							},
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"left": 824,
							"top": 8,
							"width": 209,
							"height": 168,
							"text": "Piece placement is modelled as a partial function π : Square ⇀ Piece, where square is the key and each square holds at most one piece (|dom π| ≤ 32). Empty squares are absent from dom π. As π is immutable, a applyed move returns a new function π′ rather than modifying π. It corresponds to an immutable Map<Square, Piece>"
						},
